From: GuideOS Project <guideos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Retain H700 panel routing workaround on Linux 7.2

Context refresh of Philippe Simons' ROCKNIX e455e133 panel workaround.
Linux 7.2 removed the adjacent comment. Behavior is unchanged from that
reference patch; physical panel acceptance is still required.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_tcon_top.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_tcon_top.c
@@ -229,2 +229,2 @@
-	writel(0, regs + TCON_TOP_PORT_SEL_REG);
+	writel(0x20, regs + TCON_TOP_PORT_SEL_REG);
 	writel(0, regs + TCON_TOP_GATE_SRC_REG);
